<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Activity 2 — CSS Border | Cavite Heritage</title>
    <style>
        body {
            /* ✅ 1. CSS Background Color */
            background-color: #f0f4f8;
            /* ✅ 2. Font Color */
            color: #2b2b2b;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 40px 20px;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        h1 {
            text-align: center;
            color: #9c1212;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #9c1212;
            padding-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .intro {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 18px;
            max-width: 750px;
            margin: 0 auto 35px;
        }

        .image-container {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        img {
            /* ✅ 3. CSS Border Style & Properties */
            border-style: ridge;
            border-width: 10px;
            border-color: #b71c1c #ff6f60 #ff6f60 #b71c1c;
            border-radius: 18px;
            width: 480px;
            box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
            transition: transform 0.3s ease;
        }

        img:hover {
            transform: scale(1.03);
        }

        .caption {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 18px;
            font-style: italic;
            color: #444;
        }

        .requirements {
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border-left: 5px solid #9c1212;
            max-width: 750px;
            margin: 40px auto 0;
            padding: 20px 25px;
            border-radius: 10px;
        }

        .requirements h3 {
            color: #9c1212;
            margin-top: 0;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <h1>🏛️ Historic Aguinaldo Shrine — Kawit, Cavite</h1>

    <p class="intro">
        The place where Philippine independence was proclaimed on June 12, 1898 — right here in our province.
    </p>

    <div class="image-container">
        <img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/70/Aguinaldo_Shrine_%28Kawit%2C_Cavite%29.jpg" 
             alt="Historic Aguinaldo Shrine in Kawit, Cavite">
    </div>

    <p class="caption">Aguinaldo Shrine — Kawit, Cavite: Birthplace of Philippine Independence</p>

    <div class="requirements">
        <h3>📋 Applied Properties</h3>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Background Color:</strong> Soft light blue-gray (#f0f4f8)</li>
            <li><strong>Font Color:</strong> Dark charcoal (#2b2b2b)</li>
            <li><strong>Border Style:</strong> RIDGE — 3D ridged effect</li>
            <li><strong>Border Width:</strong> 10px — bold and clear</li>
            <li><strong>Border Color:</strong> Dual red tones for depth</li>
            <li><strong>Rounded Corners:</strong> border-radius: 18px</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

</body>
</html>

